# Git worktrees: other checkouts of this repository, sitting inside it. Without
# this line `npm run format` (`prettier --write .`) rewrites files in another
# branch's worktree while somebody is editing them — measured: neither
# `.gitignore` nor this file excluded them, and Prettier 3 reads both by default,
# so `.` reached straight into them.
#
# The ESLint config ignores them too, in its own `ignores` array, and one does not
# stand in for the other: flat config does not read these files, and Prettier does
# not read `eslint.config.js`. Three tools, three lists — remove one and that
# tool walks back in.
.claude/worktrees

